%% KEDA -> Karpenter scaling. Evidence: deploy/eks/k8s/keda/scaledobject.yaml, k8s/karpenter/*.yaml.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Q as RabbitMQ shipping.orders
  participant K as KEDA
  participant H as HPA
  participant P as shipping-worker pods
  participant C as Karpenter
  participant E as EC2 arm64
  K->>Q: poll depth every 15 s (monitoring user)
  K->>H: target = ceil(messages / 20), 1..4
  H->>P: scale up (+1 pod/min)
  P-->>C: Pending pods (no room)
  C->>E: launch node (spot or general NodePool, within limits)
  E-->>P: node Ready, pods scheduled
  Note over K,H: queue empty -> cooldown 300 s -> scale down
  Note over C,E: consolidate within NodePool disruption budget
